{"speciesId":687,"names":{"fr":"Sepiatroce","es":"Malamar","en":"Malamar","ja":"カラマネロ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Doté des pouvoirs hypnotiques les plus puissants du règne des Pokémon, il manipule son adversaire à sa guise."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Tiene a su disposición los poderes hipnóticos más poderosos de entre todos los Pokémon. Controla al enemigo a su voluntad."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It wields the most compelling hypnotic powers of any Pokémon, and it forces others to do whatever it wants."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ポケモンで 一番 強力な 催眠術を 使う。相手を 意のままに 操ってしまうのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il attire ses ennemis en les hypnotisant, avant de les enserrer de ses tentacules et de les neutraliser avec son suc gastrique."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Hipnotiza a su objetivo para atraerlo y lo aprisiona con los tentáculos de su cabeza, para asestarle el golpe de gracia rociándolo con sus jugos gástricos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It lures its prey close with hypnotic motions, then wraps its tentacles around it before finishing it off with digestive fluids."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"催眠術で おびき寄せて 頭の 触手で 絡め取り 消化液を 浴びせて しとめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Doté des pouvoirs hypnotiques les plus puissants du règne des Pokémon, il manipule son adversaire à sa guise."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Tiene a su disposición los poderes hipnóticos más poderosos de entre todos los Pokémon. Controla al enemigo a su voluntad."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It wields the most compelling hypnotic powers of any Pokémon, and it forces others to do whatever it wants."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"ポケモンで 一番 強力な 催眠術を 使う。相手を 意のままに 操ってしまうのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il attire ses ennemis en les hypnotisant, avant de les enserrer de ses tentacules et de les neutraliser avec son suc gastrique."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Hipnotiza a su objetivo para atraerlo y lo aprisiona con los tentáculos de su cabeza, para asestarle el golpe de gracia rociándolo con sus jugos gástricos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It lures its prey close with hypnotic motions, then wraps its tentacles around it before finishing it off with digestive fluids."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"催眠術で おびき寄せて 頭の 触手で 絡め取り 消化液を 浴びせて しとめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Les personnes malintentionnées tentent souvent de s’approprier ses grands pouvoirs hypnotiques pour servir leurs mauvais desseins."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Posee grandes poderes hipnóticos de los que innumerables criminales se aprovechan para cometer delitos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"When it comes to strong hypnosis, there’s an endless number of people who utilize Malamar for their nefarious deeds."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"強力な さいみんじゅつを 使う。 それを 利用し 悪事を 働く者は 後を 絶たない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il fait briller les motifs qui ornent son corps afin d’attirer ses proies. L’extrémité de ses tentacules est aussi coupante qu’un rasoir."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Hipnotiza a su presa con las luces que emite su torso y la atrae hacia sí. Las puntas de sus tentáculos son extremadamente afiladas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It flashes the pattern on its torso to control its prey and draw them in. The edges of its fins are supremely sharp."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"胴体の 模様を 光らせて エモノを 操り おびき よせる。 ヒレ先は 抜群の 切れ味。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il manipule à sa guise ceux qui se sont laissé hypnotiser en observant son corps lumineux trop longtemps."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Los destellos que emite sumen rápidamente en un estado hipnótico al observador, que queda bajo su control."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Gazing at its luminescent spots will quickly induce a hypnotic state, putting the observer under Malamar’s control."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"発光体の 光を 見つめると たちまち 催眠状態になり カラマネロに 操られてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"On raconte que ses pouvoirs hypnotiques seraient à l’origine d’évènements qui ont bouleversé le cours de l’Histoire."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se dice que sus poderes hipnóticos han influido en grandes acontecimientos que han cambiado el curso de la historia."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It’s said that Malamar’s hypnotic powers played a role in certain history-changing events."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"歴史を 変えるほどの 大事件は カラマネロの 催眠能力が かかわっていたと いわれている。"}],"varieties":[{"id":687,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bind","learns":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"wrap","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"disable","learns":[[25,"egg",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"flamethrower","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"psybeam","learns":[[15,"level-up",21],[16,"level-up",21],[17,"level-up",21],[18,"level-up",21],[20,"level-up",15],[25,"level-up",15],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"peck","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",